      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you're going through a really tough period of disillusionment after having high expectations for yourself. Please know that shifting your view from \"special\" to \"good\" is not a failure; instead, it can be a grounding moment of realistic self-awareness. Sometimes the goal shouldn't be to \"change everything,\" but rather to make small, meaningful improvements in the areas you are already good at. Instead of seeing an end, view this visible ceiling as a starting point for mastering the skills you currently possess.",
